[gd_scene format=3]

; The Nave: the long nave of the drowned cathedral, east of the Drowned Hall (map offset (62, 26)). West to
; east: the doorway from the hall, a congregation of three Votaries praying toward an altar in a shaft of
; light (a gallery passes over their reach), a hatch in the floor dropping into the Cistern, and a tall
; metal wall only Mag-grip can climb, to the choir ledge and the east doorway into the Descent. Without
; Mag-grip the hatch is the only way on.

